## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Test(s) | Effort | Why first |
|----------|-------|---------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free | `addAndDoNothing` | ~1 min | Silent false-pass — zero safety value |
| 2 | Exception Handling | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | ~2 min | Broad `catch` can mask real failures |
| 3 | Conditional Test Logic | `addConditionalLogic` | ~3 min | Hidden untested paths |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | `addLoadsFromFile` | ~2 min | Filesystem coupling causes flakiness |
| 5 | Sleepy Test | `addSleepy` | ~1 min | Free speed-up, removes flake risk |
| 6 | Eager Test | `doEverythingAtOnce` | ~5 min | Split into focused tests |
| 7 | Magic Number | `quantityAfterAdds` | ~2 min | Readability improvement |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | `toStringFormat` | ~2 min | Reduces brittleness |
| 9 | General Fixture | all (via `setUp`) | ~1 min | Remove unused `rng` field |
| 10 | Ignored Test | `disabledTest` | ~5 min | Fix root cause or delete |

Items 1–5 prevent false passes or flakiness and take under 10 minutes combined. Items 6–10 improve clarity and maintainability.
